  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your fervent love of fire allows you to burn even that which doesn’t burn.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Burn! Burn! Burn!<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You deal additional fire damage equal to 1d4 + one-half your mythic tier when you attack with fire from a non-magical or alchemical source, and gain a +8 competence bonus on Reflex saves made to avoid catching on fire or to put yourself out when you are on fire. If you expend one use of your mythic power as a free action, any fire damage from your attacks bypasses an amount of fire resistance or hardness equal to your mythic tier until the beginning of your next turn.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc45\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
